### external-sources with an unknown word
# shellcheck external-sources=yes
source ./lib.sh
>>> SC1091 2:8
>>> SC1145 1:31

### external-sources with a quoted unknown word
# shellcheck external-sources="maybe"
source ./lib.sh
>>> SC1091 2:8
>>> SC1145 1:31

### external-sources with a valid value
# shellcheck external-sources=false
source ./lib.sh
>>> SC1091 2:8

### external-sources value starting with a digit is a directive syntax error
# shellcheck external-sources=1
source ./lib.sh
>>> SC1072 1:31
>>+ SC1145 1:31 -- shellcheck aborts the whole script at a malformed directive value (SC1072); this linter reports the invalid value and keeps checking
>>> SC1073 1:1
